{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"core-principles","title":"交互设计核心原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/foundations/core-principles","wordCount":2823,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-mental-models","title":"用户心智模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/foundations/user-mental-models","wordCount":2733,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-response","title":"反馈与响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/foundations/feedback-response","wordCount":2743,"readingTime":11}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础原理\n\n本章是交互设计的理论地基。无论你设计的是移动端应用、网页还是空间计算界面，下面三篇文档讨论的核心原则、心智模型和反馈机制始终适用。建议按顺序阅读：先掌握「交互设计核心原则」建立判断标准，再通过「用户心智模型」理解用户如何认知系统，最后在「反馈与响应」中学习系统如何回应用户的每一个动作。这三篇共同构成了后续所有界面模式、动效设计和评估方法的底层逻辑。\n"}